2","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji112-pingjin"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:p005","text":"天子使莊助往諭意南越王，胡頓首曰：「天子乃為臣興兵討閩越，死無以報德！」遣太子嬰齊入宿衛。謂助曰：「國新被寇，使者行矣。胡方日夜裝入見天子。」助去後，其大臣諫胡曰：「漢興兵誅郢，亦行以驚動南越。且先王昔言，事天子期無失禮，要之不可以說好語入見。入見則不得復歸，亡國之勢也。」於是胡稱病，竟不入見。後十餘歲，胡實病甚，太子嬰齊請歸。胡薨，謚為文王。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m005-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m005-0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"莊助","kind":"person","person_id":"71j_ydc_ly7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m005-0012","start":12,"end":13,"surface":"胡","kind":"person","person_id":"bvb_d1z_fd0_*A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m005-0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m005-0039","start":39,"end":41,"surface":"嬰齊","kind":"person","person_id":"bvb_d1z_fd0_*AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m005-0046","start":46,"end":47,"surface":"助","kind":"person","person_id":"71j_ydc_ly7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m005-0060","start":60,"end":61,"surface":"胡","kind":"person","person_id":"bvb_d1z_fd0_*A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m005-0067","start":67,"end":69,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m005-0071","start":71,"end":72,"surface":"助","kind":"person","person_id":"71j_ydc_ly7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m005-0079","start":79,"end":80,"surface":"胡","kind":"person","person_id":"bvb_d1z_fd0_*A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m005-0087","start":87,"end":88,"surface":"郢","kind":"person","person_id":"xp5_39k_w5w","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m005-0098","start":98,"end":100,"surface":"先王","kind":"person","person_id":"bvb_d1z_fd0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m005-0104","start":104,"end":106,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m005-0139","start":139,"end":140,"surface":"胡","kind":"person","person_id":"bvb_d1z_fd0_*A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m005-0153","start":153,"end":154,"surface":"胡","kind":"person","person_id":"bvb_d1z_fd0_*A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m005-0160","start":160,"end":162,"surface":"嬰齊","kind":"person","person_id":"bvb_d1z_fd0_*AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m005-0165","start":165,"end":166,"surface":"胡","kind":"person","person_id":"bvb_d1z_fd0_*A","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue","book_id":"b-shiji-113","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji113-nanyue"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:p017","text":"是時上方鄕文學，湯決大獄，欲傅古義，乃請博士弟子治尚書、春秋補廷尉史，亭疑法。奏讞疑事，必豫先爲上分別其原，上所是，受而著讞決法廷尉絜令，揚主之明。奏事卽譴，湯應謝，鄕上意所便，必引正、監、掾史賢者，曰：「固爲臣議，如上責臣，臣弗用，愚抵於此。」罪常釋。（聞）［閒］卽奏事，上善之，曰：「臣非知爲此奏，乃正、監、掾史某爲之。」其欲薦吏，揚人之善蔽人之過如此。所治卽上意所欲罪，予監史深禍者；卽上意所欲釋，與監史輕平者。所治卽豪，必舞文巧詆；卽下戸羸弱，時口言，雖文致法，上財察。於是往往釋湯所言。湯至於大吏，内行修也。通賓客飲食。於故人子弟爲吏及貧昆弟，調護之尤厚。其造請諸公，不避寒暑。是以湯雖文深意忌不專平，然得此聲譽。而刻深吏多爲爪牙用者，依於文學之士。丞相弘數稱其美。及治淮南、衡山、江都反獄，皆窮根本。嚴助及伍被，上欲釋之。湯爭曰：「伍被本畫反謀，而助親幸出入禁闥爪牙臣，乃交私諸侯如此，弗誅，後不可治。」於是上可論之。其治獄所排大臣自爲功，多此類。於是湯益尊任，遷爲御史大夫。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m017-0002","start":2,"end":3,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"ln1_tyi_kei","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m017-0008","start":8,"end":9,"surface":"湯","kind":"person","person_id":"04o_yps_sg0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m017-0020","start":20,"end":24,"surface":"博士弟子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"s